 * Simple implementation to detect horizontal swipe actions.
 * Accepts callbacks for on right and left swipes.
 * @example
 * ```tsx
 *  <div
      onTouchStart={onTouchStart}
      onTouchMove={onTouchMove}
      onTouchEnd={onTouchEnd}
    >
 * ```
 * @alpha
